{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1503","id":4019275324,"node_id":"PR_kwDOO5D6p87vkUY8","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1503","diff_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1503.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1503.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1503","number":1503,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"feat: generate controlled page-level MS screenshot asset package (#1490)","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes #1490.\n\n## What\n\nGenerates real page-level MS screenshot assets for every page/exact-located page from the merged #1489 locator backfill, with controlled delivery metadata, hashes, and no public/static exposure.\n\n- **424** unique page assets rendered (from 693 located pages across 635 located rows / 170 source PDFs), deduped by `ms_document_id` + `source_pdf_sha256` + `pdf_page_index_zero_based` — 269 duplicate renders prevented.\n- **0** P0 blockers: all 170 source PDFs are present with hashes matching the #1489 manifest, so the blocker map is emitted empty.\n- Validator: **pass**, 19/19 checks.\n\n## Determinism and reproducibility\n\nRendering is deterministic local PDF rasterization only — `pdfjs-dist` + `@napi-rs/canvas` at scale 2.0 with pdfjs' bundled standard fonts and packed cmaps. Two consecutive full runs produce byte-identical PNGs and an identical `package_content_hash`.\n\nEach asset records a per-asset `generation_command` that genuinely works — the script accepts `--ms-document-id`, `--source-pdf-sha256`, `--pdf-page-index-zero-based` and re-renders exactly that page. Verified: single-asset regeneration reproduces the `output_image_sha256` recorded in the manifest.\n\nNo OCR, VLM, or external model call. No production Supabase mutation, RAG reindex, or vector mutation.\n\n## Binary retention (P0 amendment)\n\nScreenshot binaries are **not** committed to git. The 424 PNGs (80MB) are written only to the local controlled package root `data/ms-screenshots/post-attempt-ms-page-screenshots/v1-9709`, which is already gitignored and is not a Vite `publicDir` or any frontend static root.\n\nThe validator does not take this on trust: `listGitTrackedScreenshotBinaries` queries the git index for images under the controlled package root plus any image anywhere in the repo whose basename matches a generated asset filename, and fails on any tracked binary without explicit `git_retention_authorized`. Scoping by filename keeps unrelated pre-existing image artifacts (the 825 QP figure crops under `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/figureasset-bulk-source-crops/`) out of the count.\n\n## Hard requirements\n\n| Field | Value |\n| --- | --- |\n| `generated_screenshot_count` | 424 |\n| `student_display_allowed_count` | 0 |\n| `public_static_url_allowed_count` | 0 |\n| `pre_attempt_fetch_allowed_count` | 0 |\n| `preload_in_frontend_bundle_allowed_count` | 0 |\n| `git_committed_binary_count` | 0 |\n| `blocked_page_asset_count` | 0 |\n\nEvery asset carries `output_image_sha256`, byte size, rendered dimensions, and a reveal-authorized controlled reference; `public_url` and `static_asset_path` are null throughout and the manifest contains no `http(s)://` URL. All 424 assets stay `candidate_internal` — no visual QA pass is claimed here, that is #1491.\n\n## Artifacts\n\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/post-attempt-ms-page-screenshot-assets.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/post-attempt-ms-page-screenshot-assets.validator-result.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/post-attempt-ms-page-screenshot-assets.controlled-package-receipt.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/post-attempt-ms-page-screenshot-assets.blocker-map.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/post-attempt-ms-page-screenshot-assets.readback.md`\n\n## Verification\n\n- `npm run method-map:build-post-attempt-ms-page-screenshot-assets` — validator `pass`, 19/19 checks; rerun produces an identical receipt.\n- 33 new tests pass, covering dedupe, cross-page expansion, the forbidden-path deny-list, the git-retention gate (including the authorized path), student-display promotion, delivery-contract tampering, and the P0 blocker path.\n- Rendered output sanity-checked programmatically: 0 blank pages, ink coverage 1–6% across all 424 images, 424 distinct image hashes.\n- `eslint` clean on both new files; `codex-preflight` artifact guard and A+ ratchet healthy.\n\nFive `semantic-kg-*` suites under `scripts/method-map/__tests__` fail, but they fail identically on a clean tree at this merge base and are untouched by this change.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)","created_at":"2026-07-09T04:19:22Z","updated_at":"2026-07-09T04:23:50Z","closed_at":"2026-07-09T04:23:50Z","merged_at":"2026-07-09T04:23:50Z","merge_commit_sha":"fc846a07dd4da084fc27d768f6b8eb8c37f10f3b","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879